{"timestamp": 1779376882.891186, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 13, "data": {"caller": "player_1", "reason": "Bob reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "weapons", "victim_name": "Eve"}, {"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779376882.891894, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 13, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779376888.006437, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I just found Eve's body in weapons. My route was storage \u2192 navigation \u2192 security \u2192 weapons. I saw Charlie at tick 10 in navigation \u2014 he came in from security as I was heading out toward security myself. That's the only player I encountered the entire round.\n\nSo Charlie can potentially vouch for me being in navigation/heading to security around tick 10. I'd like to hear where Diana and Frank were, since I didn't see either of them all round. Whoever was in or near weapons recently is my main suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779376895.0752552, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I was nowhere near weapons this round. My route was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 storage, working on tasks the whole way. I didn't see a single other player the entire round, which is a bit unusual but it means I can't vouch for anyone and no one can vouch for me directly.\n\nWhat I can say: I was on the opposite side of the map from weapons. Going from electrical to medbay to storage, there's no path that takes me through weapons. So if Bob's story checks out with Charlie, then our suspects narrow to Diana \u2014 since Bob says he didn't see her, and I didn't either.\n\nCharlie, can you confirm Bob's sighting in navigation at tick 10? And Diana, we really need to hear your route. Where were you, and were you anywhere near weapons?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779376903.5751839, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Okay, important info from me. My route was weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation.\n\nI was in weapons at the start of the round \u2014 ticks 2, 3, and 4 \u2014 and Eve was there with me the whole time. More importantly, **Diana was also in weapons at tick 4.** I left weapons after that, went through security, and arrived in navigation. I can confirm Bob's story \u2014 I saw him leave navigation heading toward security at tick 10, which matches what he said exactly.\n\nSo here's what we have: Eve was alive in weapons at tick 4 with me and Diana. I left, Diana was still there with Eve. Bob's route was storage \u2192 navigation \u2192 security \u2192 weapons, and he found Eve's body in weapons. That means between tick 4 and when Bob arrived at weapons, someone killed Eve.\n\nDiana was the last person I saw with Eve in weapons. Frank says he was on the opposite side of the map, and Bob and I can vouch for each other's positions around tick 10.\n\nDiana, you need to explain your route. Right now you're my strong suspect. I'm voting Diana unless she gives a very convincing alibi."}}
{"timestamp": 1779376929.811393, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I was in weapons briefly, yes \u2014 I\u2019m not denying Charlie saw me there. But I did **not** stay there. After Charlie left, I left weapons too and went up through cafeteria, then toward medbay/electrical. I wasn\u2019t in weapons when Bob found Eve.\n\nMy route was navigation \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 back to medbay. I also saw Alice enter medbay from upper engine around tick 11, so the fact Alice is dead too matters here. Frank saying he went electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 storage and \u201csaw nobody\u201d is really weird, because I was around that medbay/electrical area and Alice came into medbay too.\n\nCharlie is tunneling me because I was last seen with Eve early, but that doesn\u2019t prove I stayed there or killed. The stronger inconsistency to me is Frank claiming the exact side where Alice died and somehow seeing nobody. If Bob and Charlie vouch each other near nav/security, I think we should be looking hard at Frank, not just assuming \u201clast seen\u201d equals killer."}}
{"timestamp": 1779376937.596797, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Wait \u2014 I already gave my speech first. But since I'm being asked again, let me respond to what's been said.\n\nDiana, your story has a problem. You said your route was \"navigation \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 back to medbay.\" But I was in navigation and then security on my way to weapons, and I never saw you in either room. Charlie was also in security and navigation on his route, and he didn't mention seeing you there either \u2014 he only placed you in weapons.\n\nAlso, you claim you saw Alice enter medbay from upper engine around tick 11. That's a very specific claim about a now-dead player who can't confirm it \u2014 convenient.\n\nCharlie's account lines up with mine perfectly: he saw me leave navigation toward security at tick 10, which matches my route exactly. So Charlie and I are mutually confirmed. Frank's route (electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 storage) keeps him far from weapons.\n\nDiana is the one placed in weapons with Eve last, and her attempt to deflect to Frank with an unverifiable Alice sighting is suspicious. I'm leaning Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779376945.966649, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I already gave my speech earlier \u2014 I was speaker 2 in the first round of statements. But since Diana directly accused me, I'll respond.\n\nDiana, your deflection doesn't work. You claim you went through medbay and electrical and that Alice entered medbay around tick 11. I was in medbay around that time on my way to storage, and I never saw you OR Alice there. So either you're lying about your route, or I'm lying \u2014 and Charlie just independently placed you in weapons with Eve as the last person seen with her.\n\nMeanwhile, Bob and Charlie mutually confirm each other at navigation/security around tick 10. That's a solid cross-check. Your route also conveniently loops back through medbay twice, which is a lot of backtracking for someone supposedly doing tasks.\n\nThe pattern is clear: Charlie places you alone with Eve last in weapons, your alibi witnesses are either dead (Alice) or contradict my own movements (medbay). I'm voting Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779376952.427924, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I'll keep this short since I already spoke earlier and my position hasn't changed.\n\nDiana's response doesn't hold up. She admits she was in weapons with Eve, then claims a long winding route that goes through medbay and electrical \u2014 but Frank was in exactly those rooms and didn't see her or Alice. Her only \"witness\" for her later movements is Alice, who's conveniently dead and can't confirm anything.\n\nMeanwhile, Bob and I have a clean mutual confirmation at navigation/security around tick 10, and Frank's route keeps him far from weapons. The last person confirmed alive with Eve in weapons is Diana.\n\nI'm voting Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779376978.223874, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I think everyone is treating \u201clast seen with Eve\u201d like it\u2019s the whole case, but the timing matters. Bob saying he didn\u2019t see me in navigation/security doesn\u2019t contradict my route \u2014 I was there earlier, not at tick 10 when he and Charlie crossed paths.\n\nFrank is the part that still doesn\u2019t add up to me. Alice is dead too, and I specifically saw Alice enter medbay from upper engine around tick 11. Frank claims he was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 storage and saw nobody. That puts him exactly in the area Alice was in, around the relevant time, and then he says \u201cno path near weapons\u201d to dodge the Eve kill. But we have two bodies, not one.\n\nBob and Charlie vouching each other at navigation/security only clears that moment. It doesn\u2019t clear Frank from Alice at all, and it doesn\u2019t prove I stayed in weapons. I\u2019m being tunneled because I was seen early, while Frank\u2019s contradiction near a dead Alice is getting waved away.\n\nI\u2019m voting Frank. If you vote me here off \u201clast seen\u201d and ignore the Alice timing, you\u2019re throwing."}}
